  "summary": "王永庆命例以丙辰年武杀卯命、亥宫廉贞化忌为财帛兼身宫说明正格财与囚仇。作者认为命身旺且会左右魁钺等吉星，可制煞为用；列癸巳至己亥诸限的化禄及双禄吉辅，保留各限具体化曜与作用。原末句残缺不补写。",
  "summary_en": "The Wang Yung-ching example places Wu Qu and Qi Sha in the Mao Life Palace for a Bing Chen birth, with Lian Zhen Hua Ji in Hai, both Wealth and Body Palace, forming primary Cai Yu Qiu Chou. Strong palaces and auspicious support turn affliction to use. Gui Si brings Po Jun Hua Lu; Jia Wu, Lian Zhen Hua Lu; Yi Wei, Tian Ji and Tian Tong Hua Lu via the opposite empty-palace arrangement; Bing Shen, double Tian Tong Hua Lu; Ding You, Tai Yin and Tian Tong Hua Lu; Wu Xu, Tan Lang Hua Lu; Ji Hai, Wu Qu Hua Lu. The final unfinished conclusion is not supplied.",
